ndurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307704/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307704/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307704/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307704/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307704/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307704/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3077/307704/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\"><br /><br />一名称职的血食怪猎人需要敏锐的嗅觉与洞穿谎言的双眼，所幸她都具备。<br /><br />促使她踏入此地的理由是一笔丰厚的赏金——它足以支持她推进理线学的研究，以及一封华丽却艰涩的邀请函。<br /><br />若说危险？她见过狂暴的地脉乱流。<br /><br />若论刺激？或许吧，毕竟，她从未涉足过如此怪诞的宅邸。<br /><br />深绿的虚影们无声起舞，扭曲的钟摆来回摇晃，一只黑猫蹲伏在钟表上头，金色的眼睛一动不动地凝视着她。血色的月光倾泻而下，冰冷地覆在她身上。<br /><br />一场鬼魂的舞会，诡异又美好。唯独她，像个格格不入的闯入者。是的，任何舞会都需要谢幕的时机，一个不突兀，又能稍微引发遐想的时机。<br /><br />于是，她缓缓举起了手中的枪——瞄准了那虚影中的一抹红。<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"307704\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307707.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ef/Belonging-307707.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">夜鹰羽猎人帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Feathered Hunter's Hat</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />30<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶帽檐格外宽大的帽子，用于遮蔽受访者浅色的头发，使其融入夜色之中。<br />红宝石帽饰中藏着一滴血食怪的鲜血，这气味能让城堡主人打消疑虑：午夜的宴会如期举办，并无任何不速之客光临。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307708.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4d/Belonging-307708.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">16mm线膛式燧发枪<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">16mm Rifled Flintlock</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />100<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一把线膛式燧发枪，发射的每颗子弹都经过圣水洗涤和神秘祝祷。枪身镶嵌的线条式样来自理线学的最新成果，据称，它们能够为子弹引路。受访者热情地介绍了它的原理，不过，我们谢绝了受访者当场演示的提议。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307709.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/37/Belonging-307709.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">翼状秘银烛台<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Wing-Shaped Mithril Candelabra</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />79<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>秘银锻制的枝形烛台。为了融入月光，它被施以过滤光和热的术式，使火焰呈现为莹莹的蓝色。<br />“这小小的火光即是理智与疯狂最后的分界线。只要烛焰不灭，你就仍未与文明世界断绝。”</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table zh-only\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/214px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\"